# **`53_audio_synth.lc` (Web Audio & Audio DSP)**
# **Purpose**: Sound synthesis, generative music, and audio output.
# **Contents**:
# Low-level `SEND_AUDIO` frame buffer emission.
# Waveform generators: `sine_wave`, `square_wave`, `sawtooth_wave`, `triangle_wave`.
# ADSR envelope generators (`apply_adsr`).
# Musical note-to-frequency conversions (`midi_to_freq`, scales, progressions).

